  "text_to_speech": "Vanguards are holy warriors, guardians of the realm and natural born leaders. Vanguards can pull enemies from afar with Dragon’s Grasp, make them bleed with Tornado Sweep and slow them down with Crippling Bolt. They can also bolster the health of their allies with Vanguard's Blessing. They can instantly break any bonds on them by Indomitable Will and purge themselves of all evil with Iron Resolve. In their defensive stance, Vanguards are indispensable in raids. They receive minimal damage, draw enemies to them and then attack them with Sundering Steel and Shield Storm. In attack stance, Vanguards are fast and capable of doing great damage. This makes them deadly-woven PvE and PvP encounters. Vanguards can swiftly overtake their adversaries with Heroic Leap, knock them off their feet with Blazing Charge, pull them into Holy Vortex and burn them by Smite. The Vanguards' attack and control skills allow them to control and dominate in any battle, making them the most tenacious class in Revelation Online.",
